-- V79: the demo catalogue and demo appointments in French (UI V2 audit L8).
--
-- V4 and V5 seeded them in English inside a French interface. Each row is translated only while it
-- still holds the exact English seed text (matched on its fixed id AND its original value), so a
-- clinic that has renamed or edited a seeded item keeps what it wrote. Nothing is inserted or
-- deleted, and ids, codes, SKUs, prices and quantities are unchanged.

